    "article_summary": "The article describes a cooperative photoredox and N-heterocyclic carbene (NHC) catalyzed regioselective acylation of aryl cyclopropanes. The method utilizes a deconstruction-reconstruction strategy via gamma-chloro-ketone intermediates to achieve formal C(sp3)-H functionalization at the alpha-position, avoiding the need for directing groups or transition metals.",
